@startuml
' bt-view-kind: context
' bt-view-id: documentation-supply-chain:supply-context
title Documentation Supply Chain - Context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: author
' bt-element-id: docs

actor "Document Author\nResponsibility: Maintain architecture intent and operating knowledge\nContract: Role-correct Markdown source\n[[../../../../docs/architecture/START-HERE.md source]]" as author
rectangle "Documentation Corpus\nResponsibility: Expose current architecture, contracts and evidence\nContract: Navigable versioned Markdown\n[[../../../../docs/architecture/README.md source]]" as docs

author ..> docs : "authors and reviews\ncontract: versioned change"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: context
Concern: Human author and authoritative documentation corpus
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
